# This project does not currently require any secrets or API keys.
# All datasets are loaded from local files (see data/README.md) or from the
# public Hugging Face Hub (no token required for the dataset used here).
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder per project convention: if a future
# extension requires credentials (e.g. a private HF dataset, a cloud
# storage bucket for models), document the required variable here with a
# dummy value, and load it in code via os.environ — never hardcode secrets.
